@startuml
title 2. Login (issue access + refresh)
autonumber
actor User
participant Client
participant Gateway
participant Auth
database AuthDB
database Redis

User -> Client : Enter credentials
Client -> Gateway : POST /auth/login
Gateway -> Auth : route
Auth -> AuthDB : load user by email
Auth -> Auth : verify password hash
alt invalid credentials
    Auth --> Client : 401 Unauthorized
else valid
    Auth -> Auth : mint access JWT (short TTL, signed)
    Auth -> Redis : store refresh token (jti, TTL)
    Auth --> Client : 200 { accessToken, refreshToken }
    note right of Client : access token kept in memory,\nrefresh token in secure storage
end
@enduml
